# FastAPI backend conventions

- Routes stay thin: validate input with Pydantic/SQLModel models, delegate to plain functions, return typed models.
- Inject sessions with `SessionDep`; never create engines or sessions inside handlers.
- Configuration comes from `{{ package_name }}.config.get_settings()`. Add new settings as typed fields with safe defaults and document them in `.env.example`.
- Schema changes: add or modify SQLModel tables, import the module in `alembic/env.py`, run `uv run alembic revision --autogenerate -m "..."`, review the migration, then `uv run alembic upgrade head`.
- Tests override `get_session` with an in-memory SQLite engine (see `tests/test_smoke.py`).
